        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Goal:</strong> Kill the opponent at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Methods:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Initiate a Bet</strong><br>Choose to <strong>Cooperate</strong> or <strong>Betray</strong>:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If both cooperate → Each gains funds ￥.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one cooperates and the other betrays → The betrayer seizes a large amount of ￥, while the cooperator may suffer gunshot wounds (health loss/death).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If both betray → Both parties may be shot (high-risk mutual destruction).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase Items</strong><br>Use ￥ to buy lethal equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate Environmental Mechanisms</strong><br>Trigger environmental kill switches:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the <strong>gas release button</strong> → Opponents without anti-gas equipment continuously lose health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate the <strong>security line</strong> → Blocks the opponent's path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Rules:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is a luxury: Cooperation may be a trap; betrayal is the norm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources determine survival: Accumulate funds to strengthen yourself or spend to destroy the opponent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is a weapon: Those who master the surroundings control life and death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Only Rule:</strong> Survive and kill them.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Goal:</strong> Kill the opponent at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Methods:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Initiate a Bet</strong><br>Choose to <strong>Cooperate</strong> or <strong>Betray</strong>:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If both cooperate → Each gains funds ￥.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one cooperates and the other betrays → The betrayer seizes a large amount of ￥, while the cooperator may suffer gunshot wounds (health loss/death).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If both betray → Both parties may be shot (high-risk mutual destruction).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase Items</strong><br>Use ￥ to buy lethal equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate Environmental Mechanisms</strong><br>Trigger environmental kill switches:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the <strong>gas release button</strong> → Opponents without anti-gas equipment continuously lose health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate the <strong>security line</strong> → Blocks the opponent's path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Rules:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is a luxury: Cooperation may be a trap; betrayal is the norm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources determine survival: Accumulate funds to strengthen yourself or spend to destroy the opponent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is a weapon: Those who master the surroundings control life and death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Only Rule:</strong> Survive and kill them.</p>",
